<p>Quarterly results are subject to significant seasonal variations and are not necessarily indicative of the results of operations for a full fiscal year.</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q3 net loss includes an extraoridnary charge of $717 million or $0.31 per share from debt prepayments.</p>
<p>1995 Q3 In the third quarter of 1995, an unusual gain of $6 million ($.11 per share) from the sale of non-core shipping assets and a loss from Chiquita's discontinued meat business of $3 million ($.05 per share) were included in the reported net loss of $11 million ($.24 per share).</p>
<p>Year-to-date 1996 net income of $37 million ($.52 per share) includes a first quarter charge of $12 million related to industry-wide flooding in Costa Rica and extraordinary charges of $23 million resulting from debt prepayments.</p>
<p>1995 net income of $56 million ($.91 per share) included the $6 million gain on non-core ship sales, $3 million of income from discontinued meat operations, and an extraordinary charge of $5 million from debt refinancings.</p>
